{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065114/block/singleImage/3274720/df/01M81TD6QER1J6JJGST99ZJWHM.jpg?updatedAt=1795357691\"/><figcaption>元朗山水盈三房套呎價險守1萬沽 7年一手買入貶值13%｜二手成交</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，元朗山水盈本月錄得 1 宗買賣，單位為 5 座高層 A 室，實用面積約 936 方呎，三房套房間隔。 原叫價 980 萬放售 王勤學指，上址原叫價 980 萬元，議價後減價 42 萬元或約 4.3% ，以 938 萬元沽出，呎價約 10,021 元。原業主於 2019 年以 1,076.6 萬元一手買入單位，持貨約 7 年轉手，帳面虧蝕 138.6 萬元，物業期內貶值約 12.9% 。 資料顯示，山水盈位於元朗錦田高埔徑 3 號， 2020 年入伙，共有 9 幢住宅大廈及 29 幢洋房，合共提供 331 個單位。 即睇元朗山水盈放盤 (House730)</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065114/block/singleImage/3274727/wm/01M81TD4KBAKAHBR3ZP0EBH963.jpg?updatedAt=1795357691\"/><figcaption>山水盈本月錄得1宗二手買賣。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.640829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.073959+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:37:14.626090+00:00","content_hash":"b2dfccbe93a69134020f4098556ff0784151a748cd17ddbb8d32696475a5cd0e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:43:25.640829+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}